  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Man 201.02 Applicability. The rules in this chapter shall apply to any adjudicative proceeding conducted by the board with respect to complaints filed pursuant to RSA 205-A:27.\n\nSource. #6061, INTERIM, eff 7-13-95, EXPIRES 1-9-96; ss by #6162, eff 1-4-96, EXPIRED 1-4-04\n\nNew. #8028, INTERIM, eff 1-17-04, EXPIRED: 7-15-04\n\nNew. #8286-A, eff 2-16-05",
